Food items that are labelled as food items are to be reserved as a
last resort.  The vast majority of food eaten is normally corpses in
any game that's not a challenge game.

If you aren't getting enough corpses to keep from starving, you have
been descending too slowly.  When I'm exploring the mines I generally
become Satiated and whenever that drops off my status line I eat
more corpses.  By the time I've completed Sokoban I have enough
food items that I might never run out for the rest of the game.



